					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Trosol&lt;/color&gt;, Spirit Chief of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Lousa Nation&lt;/color&gt;, says that his friend has been wounded while traveling. The victim is &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cass&lt;/color&gt;, a 15-year-old coma child.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Trosol&lt;/color&gt; has nobody to spare to rescue &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cass&lt;/color&gt;, but says that if you can make it to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cass&lt;/color&gt;'s position and rescue her, she will join you.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Trosol&lt;/color&gt; says that &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 manhunting monkeys&lt;/color&gt; are wandering nearby and there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
