					<description>Ethical Chair &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Freda 'Bunny' Yee&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to insult the sincerity of her rival.

The monument is 6 x 12 in size and will require these resources (total value $432):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x320
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x160
    - Granite blocks x160
    - Limestone blocks x160
    - Slate blocks x160
    - Marble blocks x160

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task. You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.

If the monument is destroyed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; days of construction, your relations with &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt; will fall by -10.</description>
